{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","泼水游戏"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Splashing Fun"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","恢复周围友军生命，使周围敌人进入睡眠状态。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Gerda heals nearby allies and puts nearby enemies to sleep."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","用木舀向周围2格区域泼洒温泉水，使命中的友军恢复120% + 10% ATK生命值，对命中的敌人造成140% + 15% ATK伤害并使其进入持续1秒的睡眠状态，睡眠状态下无法行动，目标此前每累计受到相当于其最大生命值10%的治疗效果，或者每累计受到3次来自自身创造温泉区域的治疗，该睡眠状态延长0.5秒，至多延长至3秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Gerda uses a wooden ladle to splash spring water within a 2-tile radius, healing affected allies for 120% + 10% ATK HP and dealing 140% + 15% ATK damage to affected enemies. Enemies affected are also put to sleep for 1s and cannot move or act. Each time a target receives healing equal to 10% of their max HP or is healed 3 times by Gerda's hot spring, the sleep extends by 0.5s, up to 3s."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":34,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":54,"end":60,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":105,"end":111,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":135,"end":141,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":50,"end":64,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":101,"end":115,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":131,"end":145,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","对敌人造成的伤害值提升至150% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage dealt to 150% + 15% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":36,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":26,"end":40,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","对敌人造成的伤害值提升至160% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases damage dealt to 160% + 15% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":36,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":26,"end":40,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","对敌人造成的伤害值提升至170% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage dealt to 170% + 15% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":36,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":26,"end":40,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","对敌人造成的伤害值提升至180% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/en","Increases damage dealt to 180% + 15% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":36,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":26,"end":40,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","温泉水疗"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/en","Spring Therapy"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时向前跳跃，打断周围敌人行动并创造温泉区域。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/en","Gerda leaps forward when a battle starts, interrupting nearby enemies and creating a hot spring."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时向前跳跃最多3格，猛踩地面打通泉眼，对周围1格敌军造成200% + 20% ATK伤害并附带打断效果，随后使自身周围2格被覆盖为温泉区域，处于温泉区域的友军每秒恢复25% + 2% ATK生命值，处于温泉区域的敌人每秒恢复4% ATK的生命（不超过该敌人0.5%最大生命值）。技能施法期间处于霸体状态。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","When a battle starts, Gerda leaps forward up to 3 tiles and stomps the ground to unleash a spring, dealing 200% + 20% ATK damage with an interruption effect to enemies within 1 tile. Then she creates a hot spring within a 2-tile radius. Allies within this area recover 25% + 2% ATK HP per second, while enemies recover 4% ATK HP per second (capped at 0.5% of their max HP). Gerda is unaffected when casting this skill."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":36,"end":42,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":90,"end":95,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":111,"end":117,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":272,"end":277,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":87,"end":99,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":116,"end":122,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":151,"end":153,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":107,"end":121,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":269,"end":281,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":319,"end":325,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":383,"end":393,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害值提升至220% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 220% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害值提升至240% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 240% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害值提升至260% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 260% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","巨力猛击"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/en","Mighty Smash"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","猛击敌人造成眩晕，同时自身获得一定护盾。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/en","Gerda smashes an enemy, stunning them while gaining a shield for herself."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","使用木舀猛击敌人，造成150% + 10% ATK伤害并使目标眩晕1.5秒，同时自身获得340% + 30% ATK的护盾持续8秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Gerda smashes an enemy with a wooden ladle, dealing 150% + 10% ATK damage and stunning them for 1.5s. At the same time, Gerda gains a 340% + 30% ATK shield for 8s."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":48,"end":54,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":56,"end":62,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":138,"end":144,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":44,"end":58,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":52,"end":66,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":134,"end":148,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","护盾值提升至360% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the shield value to 360% + 30% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","护盾值提升至380% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the shield value to 380% + 30% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","护盾值提升至400% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the shield value to 400% + 30% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","降低自身受到伤害。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Reduces damage taken during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身受到伤害降低12%。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Reduces damage taken by 12% during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身受到伤害降低16%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Reduces damage taken by 16% during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身受到伤害降低20%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Reduces damage taken by 20% during battle."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","生命之泉"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Spring of Life"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","受到来自温泉的治疗效果提升，在友军受到温泉治疗时将减少“巨力猛击”的冷却时间。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","Gerda increases the healing received from the hot spring and reduces the cooldown of Mighty Smash whenever an ally is healed by the hot spring."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","自身受到来自己方温泉的治疗效果提高120%，每当有友军受到来自己方温泉的治疗效果时，“巨力猛击”的冷却时间减少0.2秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Gerda increases healing received from the allied hot spring by 120%. Each time an ally is healed by it, the cooldown of Mighty Smash is reduced by 0.2s."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","自身受到来自己方温泉的治疗效果提高150%。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the healing received from the allied hot spring by 150%."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","友军首次进入由自身创造的温泉区域时，进入霸体状态持续5秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","When an ally enters an allied hot spring for the first time, they become unaffected for 5s."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":73,"end":83,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","自身受到来自己方温泉的治疗效果提高180%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the healing received from the allied hot spring by 180%."],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","“温泉水疗”造成的打断效果变为眩晕。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","Gerda no longer interrupts enemies during Spring Therapy but stuns them instead."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“温泉水疗”技能猛踩地面时造成的打断效果变为使目标眩晕2秒。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","When Gerda stomps the ground during Spring Therapy, she stuns enemies for 2s instead of interrupting them."],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","友军首次进入温泉区域时，获得可抵御300% ATK伤害的护盾。此后每累计受到3次来自自身创造温泉区域的治疗时，再次获得可抵御150% ATK伤害的护盾。每名友军同一时间通过该技能获得的护盾上限为450% ATK。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/en","When an ally enters Gerda's hot spring area for the first time, they gain a shield that can absorb 300% ATK damage. For every 3 instances of healing the ally receives from the hot spring, they gain an extra shield that absorbs 150% ATK damage. The total shield value from this skill cannot exceed 450% ATK per ally at once."],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":62,"end":70,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":97,"end":105,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":99,"end":107,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":227,"end":235,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":297,"end":305,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","温泉大木勺"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Spring Ladle"]]}